{
 "uid": "utm-obs-07-users",
 "title": "07 - User Activity & Adoption",
 "description": "**Purpose:** product adoption and user-activity analysis from front-end telemetry.\n\n**Data source:** Elasticsearch `utm-generic-statistics*` (utm-statistics-es7), time field `timestamp`.\n\n**Privacy:** only `userIdAnonymized` is used. No identifiable user information is queried or displayed.\n\n**Data freshness:** 2026-03-23 → 2026-08-10. This is the freshest business dataset in the platform, but it is still historical — it is not a live feed.\n\n**Known gaps:** `location`, `userRoles`, `param1`/`param2` are unpopulated and `userAgent` is non-aggregatable `text`. All are declared in the gap panel rather than rendered as empty charts.",
 "tags": [
  "utm-observability",
  "users",
  "adoption"
 ],
